      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -96,
        -304
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Step 4 · targets\nChecks its input, then asks `app.step4_targets` (SQL) for the numbers the recipe aims at: OG, FG, ABV, IBU and SRM for the style (stated numbers first, then the request's hints, then the midpoint), the batch size, the mash temperature and the knobs the hints turn. Each value says where it came from. The output is checked against the step 4 contract. Writes nothing and calls no LLM: the pipeline logs it.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 300,
        "height": 220
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7324a599-d36d-4648-93e2-a005e41f207d",
      "name": "Test data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Test data · editor run\nPin this on `When Executed by Another Workflow` (open the node, use the output panel's edit / mock-data control, paste the JSON, save), then click *Execute workflow*.\nWrites nothing (`run_id: 0` belongs to no run).\n\n```json\n[{\"run_id\": 0, \"brief\": {\"named\": \"West Coast IPA\", \"stated\": {\"batch_l\": 20, \"abv\": 6.5}, \"hints\": [\"bitter\"], \"wanted\": [], \"excluded\": [], \"inventory\": [], \"unknown\": [], \"guidance\": true}, \"style\": {\"style\": {\"id\": 8, \"code\": \"21A\", \"name\": \"American IPA\", \"guide\": \"BJCP\"}, \"reason\": \"Picked 21A American IPA: the name matches (1.00).\", \"scores\": {\"name\": 4.0, \"total\": 6.33, \"words\": 1.0, \"numbers\": 1.33}, \"mismatch\": null, \"alt_styles\": [], \"candidates\": [{\"code\": \"21A\", \"guide\": \"BJCP\", \"score\": 6.33}, {\"code\": \"west-coast-style-india-pale-ale\", \"guide\": \"BA\", \"score\": 5.62}, {\"code\": \"21B\", \"guide\": \"BJCP\", \"score\": 4.03}, {\"code\": \"12C\", \"guide\": \"BJCP\", \"score\": 3.99}, {\"code\": \"21C\", \"guide\": \"BJCP\", \"score\": 3.72}], \"guide_reason\": \"no guide set or named in the request; both guides scored, best fit 21A\", \"unknown_reason\": null}, \"profile\": {\"units\": \"metric\", \"water\": {\"ca\": 0.0, \"cl\": 0.0, \"mg\": 0.0, \"na\": 0.0, \"so4\": 0.0, \"hco3\": 0.0}, \"batch_l\": 20.0, \"losses_l\": 2.0, \"inventory\": [], \"boil_off_l_h\": 4.0, \"efficiency_pct\": 72.0, \"grain_abs_l_kg\": 1.0}, \"deviations\": {\"unrated\": [], \"guidance\": true, \"deviations\": []}}]\n```",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 420
      }
    }
